          "summary": "Revised preliminary FastChem / curated HCN mole-fraction differences at the largest absolute log-ratio points on each sampled profile: isothermal: -4.38% at 4000 K and 100 bar; inverted: -4.67% at 3400 K and 39.8107 bar. Two 161-layer profiles from #284/#298; fixed 537-species network and solar budget. Only standard logK.dat solved; other archives audited. No spectra or retrieval. Normalized Asplund 2021 composition; the same ExoGibbs solver for all tables. Extrema include only points with mole fraction >=1e-12 in either table. Differences include coupled atomic abundances. These are recorded model sensitivities, not accuracy rankings, error bounds or a calibrated uncertainty distribution. Your conditions have not been evaluated.",
